59:   /* This is the actual authentication/authorization hoop. It is done in four steps:
60: 
61:      1) Try to just access the thing
62:      2) If not allowed using whatever creds are in the current session already, try to authenticate
63:      3) If authentication using already supplied credentials succeeds, try to access the thing again
64:      4) If all els fails, give the user a 401 to request new credentials
